WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:00.923
- Alright, everybody.

00:00:00.923 --> 00:00:01.827
We are back and we have the cast

00:00:01.827 --> 00:00:04.260
of "The Marvelous Mrs. Maisel" with us,

00:00:04.260 --> 00:00:06.540
Rachel Brosnahan, Alex Borstein,

00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:09.645
Tony Shalhoub and Michael Zegen.

00:00:09.645 --> 00:00:10.950
So you can see the final season

00:00:10.950 --> 00:00:12.720
of the show right now on Prime Video.

00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:14.580
And in honor of that final season,

00:00:14.580 --> 00:00:18.330
it's time for a game all
about other famous missuses,

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:19.590
which is not easy to say.

00:00:19.590 --> 00:00:21.030
Obviously I didn't kill it.

00:00:21.030 --> 00:00:23.779
This is "Name The Missing Mrs."

00:00:23.779 --> 00:00:25.799
(upbeat music)

00:00:25.799 --> 00:00:28.915
♪ Name The Missing Mrs. ♪

00:00:28.915 --> 00:00:29.748
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:29.748 --> 00:00:30.581
- [Rachel] It's a theme song!

00:00:30.581 --> 00:00:31.414
- [Kelly] Yes. You're welcome.

00:00:31.414 --> 00:00:33.420
Michael has graciously agreed to host.

00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:36.000
So Michael, I now hand
the control over to you.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:36.960
- You sure you wanna do that?

00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:37.793
- Yes, I do.

00:00:37.793 --> 00:00:39.780
- Okay. Well, thank you Kelly.

00:00:39.780 --> 00:00:40.613
- You're welcome.

00:00:40.613 --> 00:00:42.840
- In this game, I will give a clue.

00:00:42.840 --> 00:00:44.670
The answer to the clue is a famous Mrs.

00:00:44.670 --> 00:00:46.320
either fictional or real.

00:00:46.320 --> 00:00:48.360
If you know it, hit your
button and shout it out.

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:49.442
If you're right, you get a point.

00:00:49.442 --> 00:00:50.578
(bell rings)

00:00:50.578 --> 00:00:53.370
- That's the sound if you get it right.

00:00:53.370 --> 00:00:54.858
If you're wrong, the other team can steal.

00:00:54.858 --> 00:00:55.691
(Buzzer buzzes)

00:00:55.691 --> 00:00:56.524
- [Kelly] Oh.

00:00:56.524 --> 00:00:58.500
I hear that a lot.
- [Tony] Excuse me.

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:01.500
- Kelly and Tony are playing
to win a marvelous prize

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:03.184
for the left side of the audience.

00:01:03.184 --> 00:01:04.017
- Yes.

00:01:04.017 --> 00:01:06.150
(Audience cheers)

00:01:06.150 --> 00:01:08.129
- And Rachel and Alex are
playing for the right side.

00:01:08.129 --> 00:01:10.213
(Audience cheers)

00:01:10.213 --> 00:01:11.385
- [Michael] So here we go!

00:01:11.385 --> 00:01:12.218
- [Kelly] Okay.

00:01:12.218 --> 00:01:13.051
- First clue.

00:01:13.051 --> 00:01:15.570
I like when game show hosts
do that with the cards.

00:01:15.570 --> 00:01:16.920
- Collect them, yeah.

00:01:16.920 --> 00:01:19.267
- [Michael] Here we go.
Robin Williams in drag.

00:01:19.267 --> 00:01:20.421
(buzzer rings rapidly)

00:01:20.421 --> 00:01:21.625
- Mrs. Doubtfire!

00:01:21.625 --> 00:01:25.644
- [Kelly] Yeah, I knew
that one. I knew that one.

00:01:25.644 --> 00:01:28.874
- Okay, this missus is thick
and rich and her butter...

00:01:28.874 --> 00:01:29.707
(buzzer rings)

00:01:29.707 --> 00:01:30.540
- Yes?

00:01:30.540 --> 00:01:31.373
- Mrs. Butterworth?

00:01:31.373 --> 00:01:34.099
- [Michael] You got it.
(bell chimes)

00:01:34.099 --> 00:01:35.389
- [Rachel] That was amazing.

00:01:35.389 --> 00:01:37.059
- [Kelly] I was slow. I was too slow.

00:01:37.059 --> 00:01:37.892
I was, I was.

00:01:37.892 --> 00:01:38.837
Me too, we were (imitates button sound).

00:01:39.723 --> 00:01:42.180
- Come on, we got a
game show to host here.

00:01:42.180 --> 00:01:44.280
She was the TV mother of six kids.

00:01:44.280 --> 00:01:45.990
Three of them adopted, yes.

00:01:45.990 --> 00:01:48.180
- It's the Brady Bunch woman

00:01:48.180 --> 00:01:49.240
- [Michael] Yes. What was her name?

00:01:49.240 --> 00:01:50.100
- What was the mother?

00:01:50.100 --> 00:01:51.930
The Brady Bunch, Mrs. Brady.

00:01:51.930 --> 00:01:52.763
- [Michael] Yes.

00:01:53.850 --> 00:01:54.850
- Oh my God.

00:01:57.570 --> 00:01:58.403
- It's good, it's great.

00:01:58.403 --> 00:01:59.236
- Wow.

00:01:59.236 --> 00:02:00.069
- [Kelly] Look, look.

00:02:00.069 --> 00:02:02.850
- They said you were bad at
this but I didn't believe them.

00:02:02.850 --> 00:02:03.683
- [Kelly] Woo, okay.

00:02:03.683 --> 00:02:04.980
- [Michael] If you're shopping at the mall

00:02:04.980 --> 00:02:07.050
you'll probably find her
in (buzzer interrupts)

00:02:07.050 --> 00:02:08.310
- Mrs. Fields Cookies.

00:02:08.310 --> 00:02:09.900
- [Michael] That's right.
(bell dings)

00:02:09.900 --> 00:02:11.880
- [Kelly] Nicely done.

00:02:11.880 --> 00:02:12.820
Nicely done.

00:02:12.820 --> 00:02:15.233
- [Alex] I am thick and
I know about treats.

00:02:15.233 --> 00:02:16.680
- Dude, me too.

00:02:16.680 --> 00:02:17.687
That's a good stop at the mall.

00:02:17.687 --> 00:02:18.520
- I'm impressed.

00:02:18.520 --> 00:02:19.800
- Okay, here's the last question.

00:02:19.800 --> 00:02:22.290
It's worth seven points, so
we can even the playing field.

00:02:22.290 --> 00:02:23.760
- We can come back.

00:02:23.760 --> 00:02:25.710
- While her husband is busy making a list

00:02:25.710 --> 00:02:26.550
and checking it twice (buzzer interrupts).

00:02:26.550 --> 00:02:27.383
- Mrs. Claus.

00:02:27.383 --> 00:02:29.459
- [Michael] Yes.
(crowd cheers)

00:02:29.459 --> 00:02:33.120
(bell rings and siren blares)

00:02:33.120 --> 00:02:35.284
- Alex and Rachel are the winners.

00:02:35.284 --> 00:02:38.289
(audience cheers and claps)

00:02:38.289 --> 00:02:39.203
- [Kelly] Oh my God.

00:02:40.170 --> 00:02:42.510
Okay, on my show though,
everyone is a winner

00:02:42.510 --> 00:02:44.910
because it's my name up
there. I make the rules.

00:02:44.910 --> 00:02:46.650
So you're all going home.

00:02:46.650 --> 00:02:47.910
You're all actually going home

00:02:47.910 --> 00:02:50.730
with the Emeril Lagasse
French Door air fryer.

00:02:50.730 --> 00:02:51.563
You're welcome.
(audience cheers)

00:02:51.563 --> 00:02:53.433
This 26 quart multi-cooker

00:02:53.433 --> 00:02:55.825
combines 10 kitchen appliances into one.

00:02:55.825 --> 00:02:58.920
You can air fry, bake,
grill, make pizza and more.

00:02:58.920 --> 00:03:00.180
Right on your kitchen top counter.

00:03:00.180 --> 00:03:01.230
You're welcome.

00:03:01.230 --> 00:03:03.930
That's right, you're all
getting the Emeril Air Fryer.

00:03:03.930 --> 00:03:05.230
You're welcome.

00:03:05.230 --> 00:03:08.279
(audience cheers)

00:03:08.279 --> 00:03:10.410
And because Rachel and Alex won,

00:03:10.410 --> 00:03:12.480
we will go ahead and put their photos

00:03:12.480 --> 00:03:15.420
up on the Chicks Wall of
Champs who beat Kelly Clarkson.

00:03:15.420 --> 00:03:17.770
One more award for "The
Marvelous Mrs. Maisel".

00:03:19.258 --> 00:03:22.057
Give it up one more time for
this amazing cast, everybody.

